"IBM Quantum&reg; Functions are a beta feature available only to IBM Quantum Premium Plan, Flex Plan, and On-Prem (through the IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan users. Refer to [Set up IBM Quantum Functions](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) for instructions on getting access.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"הערות\">\n"
"IBM Quantum&reg; Functions הן תכונת בטא הזמינה רק למשתמשי IBM Quantum Premium Plan, Flex Plan ו-On-Prem (דרך IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan. עיין ב-[Set up IBM Quantum Functions](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions) להוראות לקבלת גישה.\n"
